  "body": "Tender: Closes on Tuesday 8 December 2026 at 2:00PM  (unless sold prior)\r\n\r\nBuilder’s Dream or Value Add Opportunity!\r\n\r\nPerched on an elevated 1,022 m² (more or less) freehold section, this magnificent multi-level cedar weatherboard family home captures sweeping, panoramic views across the Hibiscus Coast and Whangaparaoa Peninsula. Having been tenanted for the past six (plus) years, the property offers huge potential to renovate, modernise, and add significant value. It is the ultimate project for a builder, tradesman, or savvy buyer looking to use their skills to create a stunning custom home while reaping the financial rewards.\r\n\r\nDesigned for effortless family living, the home features three bedrooms, two bathrooms, and two separate living areas with seamless flow onto a sun-drenched deck for alfresco dining and entertaining. Flexible bonus spaces include a rumpus room, and a versatile room above the garage perfect as a teenage retreat, home office, or hobby space. Outdoors, the generous section leaves plenty of room for a pool, alongside three-car garaging and ample off-street parking for your boat and campervan.\r\n\r\nThe unbeatable location puts everyday convenience right on your doorstep. You are within walking distance of Stanmore Bay Pool and Leisure Centre, the beach, shops, eateries, and top schooling including Stanmore Bay School and Whangaparaoa College. A short drive to Gulf Harbour for the ferry to Auckland CBD, Silverdale and Orewa.\r\n\r\nWith an overseas vendor eager to cash up, this opportunity must be sold. Bring your vision and present your offer today!",
